(text "Module + adapter are one removable soldered assembly. Only original14 full holes pass through XIAO." (at 25 121 0) (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left)) (uuid "eda438a8-fc62-4fe9-934f-39b18ac31079"))
(text "J2 is the existing motherboard mating interface (off-board). U1 compound footprint includes its 14 physical pins." (at 25 124.5 0) (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left)) (uuid "8f1deff4-5163-4959-abe5-d7b897cbab74"))
(text "J1 contacts1..9 = S3 D11..D19; RP1..8=D11..D18, RP9=3V3_RP. Contact10=GND." (at 25 128 0) (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left)) (uuid "a6358d5a-0131-4a57-8dd8-2caf55a92ea6"))
(text "0.8mm adapter, approximately11.04mm PCB-to-adapter spacing; raises XIAO body0.8mm." (at 25 135 0) (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left)) (uuid "4f66f401-1aed-428c-897b-e1f7a9d50a3f"))
(text "S3 J3 top B2B signals excluded here and require separate top breakout. GPIO21 stays USER_LED." (at 25 142 0) (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left)) (uuid "15ae773e-63e9-4761-a80a-a176460f7fe6"))
